 35CL cL E$From 1974Do12                                                        
 35CL cL L,S$From DWBA analysis of the measured |s(|q) in 1974Do12.             
 35CL cL J$As given in 1974Do12 for levels below 5 MeV. For levels above 5 MeV, 
 35CL2cL 1974Do12 states that they tend to interpret them as 5/2+ states because
 35CL3cL the summed low-lying C{+2}S(1d{-3/2}) already exceeds the simple shell 
 35CL4cL model value for {+36}Ar and the measured |s(|q) resembles more closely 
 35CL5cL that of the 5/2+ state at 3.0 MeV than that of the 3/2+ ground state.  
